] the number of Aviaks in the area?'\nYou say, 'I can reduce their population.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Avian Threat'.\nBowyer Essana says, 'Please bring their intact feathers as proof of the job done. The Elddar give their thanks for your assistance with thining out the Aviaks of the Wood.'\n\n---\n\nAs in-tune with nature as the Elddar Elves are, Bowyer Essana has some recommendations to help ease the balance of the Unkempt Woods. With the Rallosians causing havoc with the land, the Aviaks have grown untrusting of everything. It saddens Essana, but in order for the young Elddar to be safe, the Aviak numbers must be reduced.\n1\\. Gather 5 Intact Aviak Feathers 0/5 Unkempt Woods\nIntact Aviak Feather [item=148417] drops off aviaks in the southwest corner.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141 platinum 6 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
