u say, 'I accept.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Balancing Biodiversity'.\nBowyer Essana says, 'Very good. I have your name down for taking out the local pests. Also, thank you for your service to the land.'\n\n---\n\nAs in-tune with nature as the Elddar Elves are, Bowyer Essana has some recommendations to help ease the balance of the Unkempt Woods. The deforestation done by the Rallosians has decreased the amount of space for fauna to graze, and has resulted in an increase in the population of spiders, beetles, and bats in the area. She has requested a few to be killed to help restore the balance.\n1\\. Kill 8 spiders, beetles, and bats within Unkempt Woods 0/8 Unkempt Woods\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141pp 6gp 6sp 7cp\nExperience: At Level 124 - 1.035%\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
