      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Unkempt Woods [zone=1326]\n**Who:**\n- Thornel Grayleaf - Unkempt Woods [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Compiled Rallosian Intelligence [item=148427]\n- Empty Watering Pitcher [item=148424]\n- Filled Watering Pitcher [item=148425]\n- Hearty Seed Packet [item=148423]\n- Rallosian Intelligence [item=148426]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Provisioner Aiwyn [ _General Goods_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Unkempt Woods (15 Points) [quest=12659]\n**Era:** | !Laurion's Song\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Nov 3 03:31:58 2023\nModified: Tue Apr 28 11:14:49 2026 | | **Laurion's Song Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this solo task from Thornel Grayleaf [npc=59668] in Unkempt Woods. You can find Thornel at /waypoint +2648, -3283, -279 . He is on the find tool as well CTRL-F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Thornel Grayleaf'\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'Hail and well met, newcomer. [Welcome] to the Unkempt Woods. I do hope you did not suffer any troubles to get to us, particularly considering the aggression at the river. '\nYou say, 'I appreciate the welcome.'\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'Good, good! Please, allow me to introduce myself. I am Thornel Grayleaf of the Elddar. My newfound friend here is Dagnor.'\nDagnor Butcherblock smiles and waves a well-worked hand. 'Hey. Good ta meetcha'.'\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'I have no doubt you were directed here, as we were, by the great Mother Tunare herself to tend to this [great land].'\nYou say, 'Tell me about this great land.'\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'The Elddar were pulled here - our hearts were pulled here - by the great goddess Tunare, herself. We are to be the wardens of this land, along with our dwarven neighbors. Yet... we are faced with our first [test] of our patience and dedication to the cause.'\nYou say, 'A test?'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Aye, the damned Rallosians 'ave come ta shore. They be strippin' tha woods of all flora, leavin' it but dirt.'\nThornel Grayleaf mournfully shakes his head as he looks out to the western horizon. 'And not a [seed] planted to replace the bounty they have spoiled.'\nYou say, 'I have a moment. I can plant a seed or two.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Righteous Reforestation'.\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'If it was that easy, our guards would have done it hundreds of times over by now, but alas, the frontline is a warzone. Our people have fallen back to regroup, but the Rallosians are not so keen on taking a break for our benefit. However, if you are up to the challenge, then I will not turn away an offer sent from the gods to keep and restore our beautiful land. Please go south to the Elddar village, and find the provisioner. Ask her for seeds, and she can assist from there.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Hail Provisioner Aiwyn at the Elddar camp to request the seeds for Thornel 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nProvisioner Aiwyn [npc=59444] is located in the far southeastern part of the zone in the Elddar camp, near Bowyer Essana [npc=59438].\nYou say, 'Hail, Provisioner Aiwyn'\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nProvisioner Aiwyn says, 'Oh, friend, hello! You say you need some seeds? For Thornel, I presume? I have some nice hardy specimens here that should put up with a bit of a beating.' She reaches into a small rucksack and pulls out a thin packet of seeds. 'Here you go, free of charge so long as they are planted within the Woods. While you are at it, you will need some quality water. I would recommend pulling from the southern shore, but be mindful of the local aviaks.'\nYou receive a Hearty Seed Packet [item=148423] and an Empty Watering Pitcher [item=148424].\n2\\. Gather water from the clean south end of the river 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nGather water at /way -2495, +2661, -296.\n3\\. Take down several Rallosians who may interfere 0/7 Unkempt Woods\n_Rallosian Intelligence appears on your cursor after the 7th Rallosian is killed. Plenty of Rallosians in the north west part of the zone._\n4\\. Plant and water a seed in the clearcut area 0/1 Unkempt Woods\n_/way 1215, 1720, -295 is one of the locations to plant the seeds, little mounds of dirt in the northwest section of the zone._\n5\\. Take the Rallosian Intelligence you found to Thornel Grayleaf 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 1 Rallosian Intelligence to Thornel Grayleaf.\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'Oh, you found intel during your task? Magnificent, friend.'\nYou complete the trade with Thornel Grayleaf.\n6\\. Bring Thornel the Hearty Seed Packet you got from Provisioner Aiwyn 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 1 Hearty Seed Packet to Thornel Grayleaf.\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'Ah, the seeds! Perfect. These are good quality seeds, too. Thanks for planting a few. I will try to get the others planted soon.'\nYou complete the trade with Thornel Grayleaf.\n7\\. Bring Thornel the Filled Watering Pitcher 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 1 Filled Watering Pitcher to Thornel Grayleaf.\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'There is some water left. Great! I will hold onto this for later.'\nYou complete the trade with Thornel Grayleaf.\n8\\. Check in with Thornel Grayleaf for your next steps 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou say, 'Hail, Thornel Grayleaf'\nYou have been given: Compiled Rallosian Intelligence\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'You not only managed to get a seed planted within the barren soil, but found some intelligence from our enemy. You are truly a gift from Tunare herself. Please, take this intel, posthaste, to the Dal'Vie Captain back at the village. He will know what to do with it from there.'\n9\\. Take the Compiled Rallosian Intelligence to the Dal`Vie Captain in the Elddar Village 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 1 Compiled Rallosian Intelligence to Dal`Vie Captain.\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nDal`Vie Captain pauses and looks over the documentation provided by the adventurer. 'We will comb through this, newcomer. Thank you. Additionally, please let Thornel know that he also has our thanks.'\nYou complete the trade with Dal`Vie Captain.\n10\\. Hail Thornel Grayleaf again to let him know the status of the delivery 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou say, 'Hail, Thornel Grayleaf'\nYour task 'Righteous Reforestation' has been updated.\nThornel Grayleaf appreciates your assistance in helping restore the Unkempt Woods.\nYou receive 7 copper .\nYou receive 6 silver .\nYou receive 6 gold .\nYou receive 141 platinum .\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou have gained 10 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (1.122%) - At Level 123\nThornel Grayleaf says, 'I am eternally thankful for your assistance in trying to restore our beautiful Woods. The battle is not over, so if you do have some time to spare, please speak with Dagnor here, and he will be able to fill you in on some next steps.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141pp 6g 6s 7cp\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
