      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Unkempt Woods [zone=1326]\n**Who:**\n- Dagnor Butcherblock [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bladesmith's Kit [item=148435]\n- Broken Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword [item=148441]\n- Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword [item=148440]\n- Rallosian Ore Chest [item=146359]\n- Rallosian Warblade [item=148433]\n- Thick Treant Branch [item=148434]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an enchanted dummy [npc=59436]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Unkempt Woods (15 Points) [quest=12659]\n- Righteous Reforestation [quest=12624]\n**Era:** | !Laurion's Song\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 22 02:20:09 2023\nModified: Mon Jun 22 18:45:46 2026 | | **Laurion's Song Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Prerequisite Task: Righteous Reforestation [quest=12624]**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this solo task from Dagnor Butcherblock [npc=59439] in Unkempt Woods. You can find Dagnor at the far northeastern corner of the zone at /way 2650, -3271, -280 He is on the find tool as well CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dagnor Butcherblock'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Oy. Thanks fer helpin' Thornel here. Frankly, I 'ave a [request] meself.'\nYou say, 'What request is that?'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'The war is greater than just strippin' the soil. That's just the start! We dwarves appreciate the world beneath our feet, down ta the Valley o' the Dawn, but threats ta the world above is a [threat] ta the world below.'\nYou say, 'Do you want me to take care of this threat?'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'We'll need ta strike the Rallosians head on, lest they get bold. Not just that, but ye could pull the rug out from under them by takin' their [ore].'\nYou say, 'The ore?'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Aye, their ore n' weapons. Disarm 'em while givin' us some intelligence on their arsenal. I 'ave been wantin' to get me hands on their smithin'. Are ye [up to it]?'\nYou say, 'I'm up to it.'\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Thanks, n' remember, I need ye to snag some ore n' weapons. The ore's likely closer ta their ships, but ye might 'ave ta fight 'em fer their weapons.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Blades of My Enemy'.\n\n---\n\nThornel Grayleaf's cohort, Dagnor Butcherblock, is eager to take things into his own hands, or rather, into the adventurer's hands. He doesn't just want to directly attack the Rallosians, but also to confiscate their ore. Between the confiscated ore and some examples of ogre-crafted weapons using that ore, Dagnor should be able to reverse engineer their weapons.\nTry to sneak onto the Rallosian ships to find the shipments of ore.\n1\\. Sneak onto the Rallosian ships and search for the ore 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nUpdates when you get near a ship or on the ships themselves.\n2\\. Collect 3 Rallosian Ore Chests 0/3 Unkempt Woods\nRallosian Ore Chests [item=146359] are on the ships and the shore on crates. You don't break invis. Respawn time isn't bad. I'm tri-boxing and by the time the first is done, the 2nd can go.\n\\- for me, top 2 ships had the treasure in the room (I'm not a sailor, sorry for not knowing the lingo). The south boat had it on the bow behind the room. Or maybe the stern. I can't tell which way is forward.\n3\\. Collect 8 Rallosian Warblades from Rallosian forces 0/8 Unkempt Woods\nKill Rallosians, until you get 8 Rallosian Warblade.\n4\\. Return 3 Rallosian Ore Chests to Dagnor Butcherblock 0/3 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 3 Rallosian Ore Chest to Dagnor Butcherblock.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Aye, this is the stuff.'\nYou complete the trade with Dagnor Butcherblock.\n5\\. Return 8 Rallosian Warblades to Dagnor Butcherblock 0/8 Unkempt Woods\nYou offered 8 Rallosian Warblade to Dagnor Butcherblock.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Great weapon. Used, but of good quality.'\nYou complete the trade with Dagnor Butcherblock.\n6\\. Check in with Dagnor Butcherblock for you next steps 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nYou say, 'Hail, Dagnor Butcherblock'\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nDagnor Butcherblock says, 'Ah, that's some good work there. I'm gon' get a good dwarven blade hammered from some o' the ore, so if ye've time, can ye snag somethin' more fer me? If ye can go up on the Treant Hill n' gather a branch from the treants there, I can use that as a hilt. By the time ye get back, yer other parts'll be done n' ready for buildin' out the sword.'\n7\\. Obtain 1 Thick Treant Branch on Treant Hill 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nTreants are found in the high country, a bit SE of the boats. The area can be reached from the west with ease. Map shows one spot from the south. Treants are aggro. One kill dropped 3 branches (3 players in the group).\n8\\. Return 1 Thick Treant Branch to Dagnor Butcherblock 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nHe gives you a Bladesmith's Kit [item=148435] as well as Dwarven-Rallosian Blade [item=148438], Dwarven-Rallosian Guard [item=148436], Dwarven-Rallosian Hilt [item=148439] and Dwarven-Rallosian Pommel [item=148437].\n9\\. Construct the Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword in the Bladesmith's kit 0/1 ALL\nPut the 4 in the Bladesmith's Kit and combine to make a Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword [item=148440].\n10\\. Test the Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword on an enchanted dummy 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nan enchanted dummy [npc=59436] is in the south camp. You don't have to equip the blade. Just target a dummy and right-click on it 3 times.\n11\\. Return the weapon shards to Dagnor Butcherblock 0/1 Unkempt Woods\nHand him your Broken Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword [item=148441].\nYou offered 1 Broken Dwarven-Rallosian Concept Sword to Dagnor Butcherblock.\nYour task 'The Blades of My Enemy' has been updated.\nAlthough the concept blade could not withstand use on the enchanted armor dummies in the Elddar village, this provides a lot of intel regarding Rallosian blade style and ore.\nYou receive 7 copper .\nYou receive 6 silver .\nYou receive 6 gold .\nYou receive 141 platinum .\nYou have gained 1 mercenary ability point(s)!\nYou have gained 10 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (1.122%) - At level 123\nYou complete the trade with Dagnor Butcherblock.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n141 platinum 6 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Evilel",
